WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:05,100
My salary while I was in coma was undercounted, right?

2
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:08,180
I count this as business and industry

3
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:12,440
Hospitalization fee, nutrition fee, material and labor fee

4
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,880
I have to ask the logistics department to reimburse me.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,120
One penny less

6
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,480
I took my money with me and went to sit in front of the director’s office.

7
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,920
Count it all

8
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:22,320
Captain Chen personally went to the logistics department to approve the note for you.

9
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:23,720
The highest level of industrial and commercial treatment

10
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,640
Vigo, you scared me to death.

11
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:27,880
The doctor said you have a severe loss of yang energy.

12
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:29,320
Coupled with extreme mental strength,

13
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:33,190
Director, this is from the four formations

14
00:00:33,190 --> 00:00:34,510
Especially the heyday business district

15
00:00:34,510 --> 00:00:36,670
All the debris recovered by the main formation eye on the fourth floor of B

16
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:39,900
Although the five-party giant killing formation was forcibly broken by us,

17
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:41,540
But I don’t know who is waiting to kill the game today

18
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:42,900
I will never stop practicing.

19
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:44,380
Did the technical department find out anything?

20
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:47,520
No need to look at the waste paper produced by the machine
